@TaskFlow.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5224

GET {{TaskFlow.API_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

### 1. User Token ने /api/users तपासणे (403 Forbidden येईल - कारण हे फक्त Admin साठी आहे)
GET http://localhost:5224/api/users
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..zZgCG1Tk_FKJGqu1DNJyaOl1aYEyb_VMADPCQZFyxxU

### 2. User Token ने /api/tasks तपासणे (200 OK येईल!)
GET http://localhost:5224/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..zZgCG1Tk_FKJGqu1DNJyaOl1aYEyb_.zZgCG1Tk_FKJGqu1DNJyaOl1aYEyb_VMADPCQZFyxxU